  "//optionalDependencies": "Pinning Tailwind v4's Linux native binaries. Without a committed lockfile (ADR-016), npm intermittently drops these optional platform packages on the Vercel linux-x64-gnu builder (see https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/4828), breaking `next build` with 'Cannot find native binding' or 'Cannot find module ...linux-x64-gnu.node'. Pinning them as optionalDependencies makes the install deterministic on Linux while being silently skipped on Windows/macOS (wrong platform), so local dev is unaffected. Versions track @tailwindcss/postcss; bump both together.",
